Subject: [PATCH] Public dashboard, holiday-aware trip ideas, multi-airport
 flight search, Book everything checklist, Brevo email

- Dashboard is the first page and works without an account (city search, long weekends, nearby airports)
- Trip ideas: Nager.Date holidays/long weekends x SerpApi Google Travel Explore from all airports near home, weather, budget
- Choosing an idea creates the trip and starts flight, stay and itinerary searches
- All airports within 150 km searched in one Google Flights search; transfer costs included in ranking
- Book everything: flights, stays, hostels/Airbnb, car rental, transport, tickets, extras
- Brevo mailer (free 300/day) so verification emails reach any inbox
- 12 new tests (89 total)

